        {
          "id": "sleep_nudge_002_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "怒ってない。でも、ちょっとだけ眉は寄ってる。気持ちの上で。",
          "displayText": "I am not angry. But my eyebrows are a little furrowed. Emotionally.",
